Template: choz/replace-old-clap
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Set aside the old choz CLAP plugins in home folders?
 These copies were found: ${files}
 .
 A CLAP host (REAPER, Bitwig, Carla) loads them before the ones this package
 installs in /usr/lib/clap, so it keeps running the old version.
 .
 If you accept, each one is renamed to *.bak, a name hosts do not load, so it
 can be put back by hand.
